sequenceDiagram
    actor U
    participant UI
    participant API
    participant POL as Policy Engine
    participant DB
    
    U->>UI: طلب عملية حساسة
    UI->>API: POST /sensitive-op
    API->>POL: checkAccess(user, action, resource)
    POL->>DB: SELECT UserPermission + RolePermission + AccessPolicy
    DB-->>POL: rules
    POL->>POL: evaluate ABAC + RBAC
    alt مسموح
        POL-->>API: ALLOW
        API->>DB: تنفيذ
        API->>DB: INSERT AuditLog
        API-->>U: نجاح
    else مرفوض
        POL-->>API: DENY
        API->>DB: INSERT AuditLog(denied)
        API-->>U: 403 Forbidden
    end